* BD139 - Fairchild Semiconductor model (Fairchild is now part of onsemi)
* Source copy: LTspice standard.bjt (via github.com/kicad-spice-library/KiCad-Spice-Library)
* Modified 2026-11-12: removed the LTspice-only info parameters Vceo=80 Icrating=3 mfg=fairchild (ngspice rejects them; no electrical effect)
* Replaces the onsemi/MODPEX model Qbd139 (2004), whose IS=1e-9 gives Vbe ~0.33 V at 4 mA - unusable for the Vbe multiplier
* Checked in ngspice 45.2 (2026-11-12): Vbe 0.63 V, hfe ~200 at Ic 10 mA
.MODEL BD139 NPN ( IS=2.3985E-13 BF=244.9 NF=1.0 BR=78.11 NR=1.007 ISE=1.0471E-14 NE=1.2 ISC=1.9314E-11 NC=1.45 VAF=98.5 VAR=7.46 IKF=1.1863 IKR=0.1445 RB=2.14 RBM=0.001 IRB=0.031 RE=0.0832 RC=0.01 CJE=2.92702E-10 VJE=0.67412 MJE=0.3300 FC=0.5 CJC=4.8831E-11 VJC=0.5258 MJC=0.3928 XCJC=0.5287 XTB=1.1398 EG=1.2105 XTI=3)
